{"id":"en_betrayed-heiress","title":"Betrayed Heiress","titleEn":"Betrayed Heiress","description":"Exiled for five years from a post-apocalyptic sanctuary after Celeste, a false heiress, frames her, Elaira Valen comes back marked by her ordeal. She cuts herself off from her family and enters a marriage she did not choose with Kael, a commander of Blackridge. As Kael comes to respect her, she pieces together what really happened, restores her reputation, and shapes a future defined by her own choices. Betrayed Heiress can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/betrayed-heiress/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/betrayed-heiress/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Revenge","Substitute Bride","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtl26/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_betrayed-heiress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtl26/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-heiress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtl26/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-heiress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtl26/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-heiress_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtl26/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-heiress_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0",